<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-AU">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<script>document.documentElement.className+=' js';</script>
<title>EDLC — Excavation & Design Co | Earthworks, Exposed Concrete & Exterior Design, Adelaide</title>
<meta name="description" content="EDLC — Excavation & Design Co. Earthworks, exposed concrete and exterior design across Adelaide. One crew from first dig to finished finish. Message us for a quote.">
<meta property="og:title" content="EDLC — Excavation & Design Co">
<meta property="og:description" content="Earthworks. Exposed concrete. Exterior design. Adelaide ground work done right — then made beautiful.">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="assets/favicon.png">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Marcellus+SC&family=Geist:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" media="print" onload="this.media='all'">
<noscript><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Marcellus+SC&family=Geist:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"></noscript>
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#181A15;
  --bg2:#20231C;
  --ink:#F2F0E6;
  --muted:#A9A491;
  --line:rgba(255,255,255,.12);
  --accent:#C9A227;
  --accent2:#E4C55C;
  --dark:#101208;
  --dark2:#101208;
  --dink:#F7F4E8;
  --dmut:#A9A491;
  --font-display:'Marcellus SC',ui-serif,Georgia,serif;
  --font-sans:'Geist',ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;
}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.62;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;overflow-x:hidden}
img{max-width:100%;display:block}
a{color:inherit}
.wrap{width:min(1180px,92vw);margin-inline:auto}

html.js .drop{opacity:0;transform:translateY(22px);transition:opacity .7s ease-out,transform .7s ease-out}
html.js .drop.in{opacity:1;transform:none}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  html.js .drop{opacity:1;transform:none;transition:none}
  *{animation-duration:.001s !important;transition-duration:.001s !important}
}

.nav{position:fixed;inset:0 0 auto 0;z-index:60;background:rgba(14,16,9,.97);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);border-bottom:2px solid var(--accent)}
.nav-in{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1.4rem;height:80px}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.9rem;color:#fff;text-decoration:none}
.brand img{height:48px;width:auto;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;padding:4px}
.brand-name{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.28rem;line-height:1;color:#fff;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.02em}
.brand-sub{font-size:.56rem;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#E4C55C;font-weight:700}
.nav-links{display:flex;gap:1.35rem;margin-left:auto;align-items:center}
.nav-links a{color:#B5AF98;text-decoration:none;font-size:.92rem;font-weight:500}
.nav-links a:hover{color:#fff}
.nav-cta{background:var(--accent);color:#1A1505 !important;padding:.55rem 1.2rem;border-radius:6px;font-weight:700}
.nav-cta:hover{filter:brightness(1.08)}
.burger{display:none;margin-left:auto;background:none;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);border-radius:6px;padding:.4rem .6rem;cursor:pointer}
.burger span{display:block;width:20px;height:2px;background:#fff;margin:4px 0;transition:.3s}
.burger.open span:nth-child(1){transform:translateY(6px) rotate(45deg)}
.burger.open span:nth-child(2){opacity:0}
.burger.open span:nth-child(3){transform:translateY(-6px) rotate(-45deg)}
@media(max-width:920px){
  .nav-links{position:fixed;inset:80px 0 auto 0;background:rgba(14,16,9,.97);flex-direction:column;padding:1.2rem;gap:1rem;transform:translateY(-140%);transition:transform .35s ease;border-bottom:2px solid var(--accent)}
  .nav-links.open{transform:none}
  .nav-links a{width:100%;text-align:center;padding:.5rem 0}
  .nav-cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:.3rem}
  .burger{display:block}
}

.hero{position:relative;min-height:95vh;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#262A1E 0%,#1C1F16 58%,#131509 100%);overflow:hidden;padding-top:80px}
.hero canvas{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;display:block}
.hero-shade{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,.02) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.03) 38%,rgba(9,10,5,.55) 100%);pointer-events:none}
.hero-shade::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(9,10,5,.92) 0%,rgba(9,10,5,.62) 42%,rgba(9,10,5,.18) 70%,rgba(9,10,5,.04) 100%)}
.hero-in{position:relative;z-index:2;padding-block:12.5vh 3.4rem;width:100%}
.hero-kicker{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.65rem;color:#E4C55C;font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.26em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:1rem}
.hero-kicker::before{content:"";width:36px;height:2px;background:var(--accent)}
.hero h1{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(2.3rem,5.8vw,4.5rem);line-height:1.06;color:#F8F5E9;font-weight:700;max-width:22ch;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.hero h1 em{font-style:normal;color:#E4C55C}
.hero-sub{margin-top:1.1rem;color:#BDB69E;font-size:clamp(.98rem,1.5vw,1.09rem);max-width:56ch}
.hero-cta{display:flex;gap:.9rem;margin-top:1.8rem;flex-wrap:wrap}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;padding:.85rem 1.55rem;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;font-size:.95rem;transition:transform .15s ease,filter .15s ease}
.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);filter:brightness(1.06)}
.btn-primary{background:var(--accent);color:#1A1505}
.btn-ghost{border:1.5px solid rgba(242,248,243,.35);color:#F8F5E9}
.hero-strip{margin-top:2.6rem;display:flex;gap:2.6rem;flex-wrap:wrap;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);padding-top:1.2rem}
.hero-strip p{color:#7E9186;font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700}
.hero-strip strong{display:block;color:#F8F5E9;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.05rem;margin-top:.2rem;font-weight:600}

section{padding-block:5.4rem}
.sec-head{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:2.4rem}
.sec-head::before{content:"";width:40px;height:3px;background:var(--accent);flex:none;align-self:center;border-radius:2px}
.sec-kicker{font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#E4C55C;font-weight:700}
.sec-title{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(1.75rem,4vw,2.7rem);font-weight:700;line-height:1.12;margin-top:.35rem;max-width:28ch;color:#F2F0E6;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.sec-sub{color:var(--muted);max-width:60ch;margin-top:.85rem}

.svc-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(241px,1fr));gap:1.15rem}
.svc{background:rgba(255,255,255,.045);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:1.65rem 1.5rem;position:relative;overflow:hidden;transition:border-color .2s ease,transform .2s ease,box-shadow .2s ease}
.svc:hover{border-color:var(--accent);transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 14px 34px rgba(0,0,0,.4)}
.svc::after{content:"";position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:44px;height:3px;background:var(--accent);transition:width .3s ease}
.svc:hover::after{width:100%}
.svc-ico{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:9px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2B2A1A,#C9A227);display:grid;place-items:center;margin-bottom:.95rem}
.svc-ico svg{width:22px;height:22px;stroke:#F1E3B2;fill:none;stroke-width:1.7;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}
.svc h3{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:1.12rem;color:#F2F0E6;margin-bottom:.35rem}
.svc p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.94rem}

.band{background:var(--dark);border-block:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14)}
.band .sec-title{color:var(--dink)}
.band .sec-kicker{color:#E4C55C}
.band .sec-sub{color:var(--dmut)}
.steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(241px,1fr));gap:1.15rem}
.step{background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);border-radius:10px;padding:1.55rem 1.45rem}
.step-n{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.75rem;line-height:1;color:#E4C55C;margin-bottom:.5rem;font-weight:700}
.step h3{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:1.06rem;color:var(--dink);margin-bottom:.3rem}
.step p{color:var(--dmut);font-size:.92rem}

.why-block{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.26fr .74fr;gap:2.4rem;align-items:start}
@media(max-width:980px){.why-block{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2rem}}
.why-list{display:grid;gap:1.05rem}
.why-item{display:flex;gap:.95rem;align-items:flex-start}
.why-tick{flex:none;width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:6px;background:var(--accent);display:grid;place-items:center;margin-top:.2rem}
.why-tick svg{width:14px;height:14px;stroke:#0B0F12;fill:none;stroke-width:2.8;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}
.why-item h3{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:1.08rem;color:#F2F0E6}
.why-item p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.93rem;margin-top:.1rem}
.why-visual{border-radius:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(255,255,255,.05),rgba(255,255,255,.02));padding:1.7rem;display:grid;place-items:center}
.why-visual img{width:min(330px,94%);border-radius:8px}
.why-visual p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:1rem;font-size:.88rem;text-align:center}

.tail{background:#20231C;border-block:1px solid var(--line)}
.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.65rem;margin-top:1.3rem}
.chip{border:1px solid rgba(201,162,39,.32);border-radius:999px;padding:.5rem 1.15rem;font-size:.88rem;color:#E4C55C;background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);font-weight:600}
.tail-note{color:var(--muted);font-size:.93rem;margin-top:1.2rem}

.close-band{background:var(--dark);border-block:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);text-align:center}
.close-band .sec-head{justify-content:center;text-align:center}
.close-band .sec-head::before{display:none}
.close-band .sec-title{color:var(--dink);max-width:none;margin-inline:auto}
.close-band .sec-kicker{color:#E4C55C}
.close-band .cta-sub{color:var(--dmut);max-width:58ch;margin:1rem auto 0}
.cta-row{display:flex;gap:.9rem;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:1.9rem}
.cta-lines{margin-top:1.6rem;display:flex;gap:2.2rem;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
.cta-lines p{color:var(--dmut);font-size:.95rem}
.cta-lines a{color:var(--dink);text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}
.cta-lines a:hover{color:#E4C55C}

footer{background:#101208;border-top:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);color:#A9A491;padding-block:4.2rem 2rem}
.foot-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.21fr .79fr;gap:2.8rem}
@media(max-width:880px){.foot-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2rem}}
.foot-brand{display:flex;gap:.9rem;align-items:center;margin-bottom:1.05rem}
.foot-brand img{height:52px;width:auto;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;padding:4px}
.foot-brand-name{font-family:var(--font-display);color:#F2F8F3;font-size:1.24rem;line-height:1;font-weight:700}
.foot-brand-sub{font-size:.56rem;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#E4C55C;font-weight:700}
.foot h4{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;color:#F2F8F3;font-size:1.06rem;margin-bottom:.8rem}
.foot p,.foot a{font-size:.93rem;line-height:1.85;color:#A9A491;text-decoration:none}
.foot a:hover{color:#F2F8F3}
.foot-bottom{border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);padding-top:1.5rem;margin-top:3rem;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:.79rem;color:#8A8468}
section#lbq{--lbq-bg:#181A15;--lbq-ink:#F2F0E6;--lbq-muted:#A9A491;--lbq-panel:rgba(255,255,255,.045);--lbq-line:rgba(255,255,255,.12);--lbq-accent:#C9A227}
.gal-head{margin-bottom:2.2rem}
.gal-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr));gap:1rem}
.gal{position:relative;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--dark);margin:0}
.gal img{width:100%;height:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;transition:transform .45s ease}
.gal.wide{grid-column:1/-1}
.gal.wide img{aspect-ratio:auto}
.gal:hover img{transform:scale(1.045)}
.gal-cap{position:absolute;inset:auto 0 0 0;padding:.85rem 1rem .8rem;background:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent,rgba(8,10,14,.82) 42%);color:#fff;font-size:.86rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.01em}
.gal-note{margin-top:1.35rem;color:var(--muted);font-size:.92rem}
@media(max-width:640px){.gal-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<nav class="nav" aria-label="Main">
  <div class="wrap nav-in">
    <a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="EDLC — Excavation & Design Co home">
      <img src="assets/logo.png" alt="EDLC — Excavation & Design Co logo" height="48">
      <span>
        <span class="brand-name">EDLC</span><br>
        <span class="brand-sub">Excavation & Design Co · Adelaide</span>
      </span>
    </a>
    <button class="burger" id="burger" aria-label="Toggle menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="navlinks">
      <span></span><span></span><span></span>
    </button>
    <div class="nav-links" id="navlinks">
      <a href="#services">What we do</a>
      <a href="#recent">Recent work</a>
      <a href="#process">How we work</a>
      <a href="#areas">Enquire</a>
      <a class="nav-cta" href="#quote">Request a quote</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<header class="hero" id="top">
  <canvas id="heroCanvas" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
  <div class="hero-shade"></div>
  <div class="wrap hero-in">
    <p class="hero-kicker">Earthworks · Exposed concrete · Exterior design — Adelaide</p>
    <h1>Ground work done right — <em>then made beautiful.</em></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Earthworks, exposed concrete and exterior design across Adelaide. One crew from the first dig to the finished front yard — machines, concrete and design under one banner.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#quote">Request a quote</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://www.facebook.com/people/EDLC/61588460654163/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Message us</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-strip">
      <p><strong>Earthworks</strong>site cuts, drainage & prep</p>
      <p><strong>Exposed concrete</strong>driveways, paths & slabs</p>
      <p><strong>Exterior design</strong>finished spaces that sell</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="edl-scope" id="services">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head drop">
      <div>
        <p class="sec-kicker">What we do</p>
        <h2 class="sec-title">From raw ground to finished exterior.</h2>
        <p class="sec-sub">Three trades, one crew — so nothing gets lost between the dig and the design.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="svc-grid">
      <article class="svc drop">
        <div class="svc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 20h18"/><rect x="4" y="12" width="7" height="5" rx="1"/><path d="M11 14h5l3-6"/><circle cx="7" cy="19" r="1.6"/><circle cx="16" cy="19" r="1.6"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Site cuts & earthworks</h3>
        <p>Excavation, levelling, trenching and site prep done clean and to plan.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="svc drop">
        <div class="svc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 8c3-3 6-3 9 0s6 3 9 0"/><path d="M3 13c3-3 6-3 9 0s6 3 9 0"/><path d="M3 18c3-3 6-3 9 0s6 3 9 0"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Exposed aggregate concrete</h3>
        <p>Driveways, paths and slabs finished in exposed aggregate and specialty finishes.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="svc drop">
        <div class="svc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="1"/><path d="M4 10h16M10 4v16"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Base preparation</h3>
        <p>Footings, base prep and set-out ready for the next trade — measured, checked, documented.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="svc drop">
        <div class="svc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3s6 6 6 11a6 6 0 0 1-12 0c0-5 6-11 6-11z"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Drainage & stormwater</h3>
        <p>Trenching, agi lines and stormwater run-off handled before the concrete goes down.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="svc drop">
        <div class="svc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="4" y="6" width="16" height="12"/><path d="M4 12h16M9 6v6M15 6v6M6 12v6M12 12v6M18 12v6"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Retaining & garden walls</h3>
        <p>Structural and feature walls that hold the levels and frame the space.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="svc drop">
        <div class="svc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 21v-8"/><path d="M12 13C8 13 6 10 5 6c4 0 7 2 7 7z"/><path d="M12 13c4 0 6-3 7-7-4 0-7 2-7 7z"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Exterior design</h3>
        <p>Planting, screening and finishing touches that turn ground work into a front yard.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="edl-method band" id="process">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head drop">
      <div>
        <p class="sec-kicker">How we work</p>
        <h2 class="sec-title">One crew, start to finish.</h2>
        <p class="sec-sub">No handoffs, no finger-pointing — the same team owns the whole result.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step drop"><p class="step-n">01</p><h3>Walkthrough</h3><p>We look at the site together, talk levels and what you want to end up with.</p></div>
      <div class="step drop"><p class="step-n">02</p><h3>Plan & set-out</h3><p>Clear scope, measured set-out and a start date you can plan around.</p></div>
      <div class="step drop"><p class="step-n">03</p><h3>The works</h3><p>Machines, concrete and detail work — staged cleanly, neighbours considered.</p></div>
      <div class="step drop"><p class="step-n">04</p><h3>Finishing</h3><p>Final levels checked, site tidied, finished exterior handed over.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="edl-why" id="why">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="why-block">
      <div class="drop">
        <p class="sec-kicker">Why EDLC</p>
        <h2 class="sec-title" style="margin-top:.35rem">The value of one crew.</h2>
        <div class="why-list" style="margin-top:1.6rem">
          <div class="why-item">
            <span class="why-tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5"/></svg></span>
            <div><h3>Earthworks + concrete + design</h3><p>One team owns every stage — the levels match the concrete matches the garden.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="why-item">
            <span class="why-tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5"/></svg></span>
            <div><h3>Machines on the books</h3><p>Excavators and dumpers on hand, so nothing waits on hire gear or weather gaps.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="why-item">
            <span class="why-tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5"/></svg></span>
            <div><h3>Adelaide local</h3><p>Working across Adelaide — recent jobs include full base preparation in Mitcham.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="why-item">
            <span class="why-tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5"/></svg></span>
            <div><h3>Finish-focused</h3><p>We are called Excavation & DESIGN for a reason — the last 10% is the point.</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="why-visual drop">
        <img src="assets/work.jpg" alt="EDLC — Excavation & Design Co">
        <p>EDLC — Excavation & Design Co, Adelaide.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="edl-recent" id="recent">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="gal-head drop">
      <p class="sec-kicker">Recent work</p>
      <h2 class="sec-title">Sites we have shaped.</h2>
      <p class="sec-sub">From base preparation to finished exterior — a look at recent Adelaide jobs.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="gal-grid">
      <figure class="gal drop">
        <img src="assets/gal_1.jpg" alt="Excavator digging a deep trench in a residential yard" loading="lazy">
        <figcaption class="gal-cap">Trenching for an extension</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="gal drop">
        <img src="assets/gal_2.jpg" alt="Deep rectangular footing trenches cut into clay soil" loading="lazy">
        <figcaption class="gal-cap">Footing trenches, set out true</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="gal drop">
        <img src="assets/gal_3.jpg" alt="Tracked dumper and excavator preparing a driveway base in front of a modern home" loading="lazy">
        <figcaption class="gal-cap">Base prep before the pour</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="gal drop">
        <img src="assets/gal_4.jpg" alt="Smooth finished concrete driveway and path next to a shed" loading="lazy">
        <figcaption class="gal-cap">Finished concrete path</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="gal drop">
